{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X的大块直接交代人物当下的状态、原因和心理转折，连续扫下来能还原完整故事；Y只看高亮词时，部分屏缺少必要的因果和承接。small：判平，X的感受比喻更贴近人物体验，但有同屏堆叠近义比喻的问题；Y的补充有些能丰富情境，也有不少音乐描写和抽象概括，未必能有效补充人物感受。core：Y更明确地呈现幸福与悲伤同时存在，尤其S13的表达直接点出了核心；concise：X扩写较少，Y有多处同义解释和重复铺陈；human：X整体口语感更好，Y有“气味、身体感觉、幻想、遗憾和快感混在一起”“进入终结句才真正松下来”等名词堆叠或术语化表达，虽然X也有“像滑进桥洞般清澈”这样的搭配问题；fine：X的小字更多落在呼吸、指尖、掌心、身体松紧等具体体验上，Y不少内容转向描述声部、旋律和音色，而不是观众此刻的感受。load：Y的高亮块明显更短，X尤其S13、S14的大块文字偏多，34至39秒内连续扫读的负担更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f8c76e5f-763f-4ab9-8fe6-164ddff8a213", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T224811699122Z", "elapsed_seconds": 154.39, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T22:50:46.098576+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "629abd1d588bead19c311e378cc43fffc4ebb5eb1232cb9151dc6b1d789f86aa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "9